      en: ["Elevation: 1,112 meters.", "Rock type: Cretaceous limestone and marl (~100 million years old).", "Annual rainfall: approximately 700 mm.", "Forest area: ~200 km² of cork oak woodland.", "Length of Medjerda River: 460 km (total).", "Annual cork production: about 5,000 tons."],
